<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>The Man Behind the Mask</title>

    <meta name="description" content="The Man Behind the Mask — a story about love, loss, truth, acceptance and starting again.">

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
            background: #f7f5f1;
            color: #252525;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        /* HERO */

        .hero {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            background:
                linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.35), rgba(0,0,0,0.45)),
                url("message.png") center center / cover no-repeat;
        }

        .hero-content {
            max-width: 850px;
            color: white;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6.5rem);
            font-weight: normal;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            text-shadow: 0 3px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.5rem);
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .scroll {
            margin-top: 50px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        /* CONTENT */

        section {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 90px 25px;
        }

        .intro {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .intro h2 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: normal;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .intro p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: auto;
        }

        .divider {
            width: 60px;
            height: 1px;
            background: #555;
            margin: 45px auto;
        }

        /* BOOK */

        .book {
            background: white;
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
        }

        .book h2 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: normal;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .book p {
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto 25px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        .book-title {
            font-style: italic;
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }

        /* QUOTE */

        .quote {
            text-align: center;
        }

        blockquote {
            font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 4vw, 3rem);
            font-style: italic;
            font-weight: normal;
            line-height: 1.4;
            max-width: 750px;
            margin: auto;
        }

        /* FOOTER */

        footer {
            background: #222;
            color: #ddd;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 45px 20px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        footer p {
            margin: 5px 0;
        }

        /* MOBILE */

        @media (max-width: 600px) {

            .hero {
                min-height: 90vh;
            }

            section {
                padding: 65px 20px;
            }

            .intro h2,
            .book h2 {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }

            .intro p,
            .book p {
                font-size: 1.05rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <!-- HERO -->

    <header class="hero">

        <div class="hero-content">

            <h1>The Man Behind the Mask</h1>

            <p>
                Love. Loss. Truth. Acceptance. Starting again.
            </p>

            <div class="scroll">
                ↓
            </div>

        </div>

    </header>


    <!-- INTRODUCTION -->

    <section class="intro">

        <h2>Taking off the mask.</h2>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <p>
            For years, I thought I had to be someone else to be loved.
            I hid behind the version of myself that I thought people wanted to see.
        </p>

        <br>

        <p>
            This is a story about what happened when the mask finally came off.
        </p>

    </section>


    <!-- BOOK -->

    <section class="book">

        <h2>The Book</h2>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <div class="book-title">
            The Man Behind the Mask
        </div>

        <p>
            A deeply personal story about love, heartbreak, loss,
            mistakes, truth, acceptance and learning to choose yourself.
        </p>

        <p>
            Sometimes healing doesn't mean forgetting someone.
            Sometimes it means finally seeing yourself clearly.
        </p>

    </section>


    <!-- QUOTE -->

    <section class="quote">

        <blockquote>
            “I can love somebody and still let them go.”
        </blockquote>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <blockquote>
            “I deserve to be a choice. Not an option.”
        </blockquote>

    </section>


    <!-- FINAL MESSAGE -->

    <section class="intro">

        <h2>Remember this.</h2>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <p>
            Support those who support you.<br>
            Love those who love you.<br>
            Ignore those who ignore you.
        </p>

        <br>

        <p>
            And never chase people who are comfortable losing you.
        </p>

    </section>


    <!-- FOOTER -->

    <footer>

        <p>The Man Behind the Mask</p>

        <p>© 2026</p>

    </footer>

</body>
</html>
